⚡ 1. UNIFIED EQUATION → SOLVER SPEC (FULL EXPANSION)

You already defined the unified equation.Now we define how it is solved.

A solver needs:

discretization

update rules

stability conditions

boundary conditions

timestep logic

Here is the solver skeleton:

solver unified_solver {
    grid: adaptive_mesh(x, t)
    timestep: dt = stability_condition(M, D, K)

    update {
        phi_tt = (F - D*phi_t - K*phi) / M
        phi_t  = phi_t + dt * phi_tt
        phi    = phi + dt * phi_t
    }

    boundary {
        type: absorbing | reflective | periodic
    }
}

